
===== n=4: m=3, 2^m=8 tilings =====
 (Q) sigma=complement: True; sigma,flip commute: True; <sigma,flip>=(Z/2)^2 => FULL 8 -> HALF(/sigma) 6 -> QUARTER(/<sigma,flip>) 3; orbit sizes {2: 2, 4: 1}
     blue subspace W dim w=2; blue LINES = W/flip = 2^(w-1)=2 (= sigma-fixed part of the quarter)
 (H) complement-H-pairing H(T)=H(T^op): True; H values (sample) [1, 3, 5] (all ODD, Redei)
 (R) BLUE flip-rank rho_W (SC cover within W, w=2 half-addr bits) = 1 (log2 #SC=1, #SC=2); vs full-cube rho_SC=1; excess rho_W-lb=0

